## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.user

## Rider / VS
.idea/
.vs/

## Playwright browser cache is machine-global (%LOCALAPPDATA%\ms-playwright) — nothing to ignore here,
## but screenshots written during runs (default temp path) should never be committed:
screenshots/

## Run artifacts are named after the run GUID. They land here whenever Playwright:ScreenshotDirectory
## resolves to a relative path, and they can contain full-page screenshots of a real authenticated
## session (names, fiscal identifiers) — never commit them.
[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]/
